# ===== Incubator closed-loop control + open-loop heated base =====
#  chamber: G = 32.7/(775s+1), lambda=300s  -> Kp=7.90  Ki=1.02e-2  b=0.5
#  glass:   G = 38.7/(348s+1), lambda= 60s  -> Kp=14.99 Ki=4.31e-2  b=0.5
#  base:    OPEN LOOP, no sensor on the pane, max 45 %, backs off to 35 % above T_cham 41.0 C, cut above 43.0 C
#           calibration: T_base ~= 26.4 + 0.456*duty  (chamber 39 C, amb ~19.5 C)
#  duty in PERCENT, Ts = 1 s, clamping anti-windup, trip at 55.0 C
#  default setpoints: chamber 39.0 C, glass 48.0 C
#  A1 not connected (thermistor failed)
#  SCD30 removed (module failed): no CO2, RH, dew point or fog margin
#  ADS1115 ok
#  MAX31865 ok
#  well thermistor ok, reading 19.68 C
#
#  COMMANDS
#    go       start closed-loop control (integrators preloaded from ambient)
#    off      everything off, loops reset, base heater off
#    sc 39    set CHAMBER setpoint, degC   (max 50)
#    sg 48    set GLASS setpoint, degC     (max 50)
#    b45      BASE glass duty %, open loop (max 45, 0 to switch off)
#             independent of mode. If T_cham goes over 41 C the duty is
#             backed off 0.5 %/s down to 35 %; over 43 C it is cut outright
#    h25      MANUAL heater duty %  (leaves closed loop)
#    g20      MANUAL glass duty %   (leaves closed loop)
#    st       print setpoints and controller internals
#    n text   write a note into the log
#    ?        this help
#
#  COLUMNS
#    T_cham  PT1000, chamber air (control)   T_glass  ITO lid (control)
#    T_well  well / reservoir water          T_amb    room air
#    marg    T_glass - T_cham
#    base%   base glass duty, OPEN LOOP, no sensor on the pane
#
